      "content": "it's not just \"overwhelmed\" though. it feels like a literal trap. i look at the numbers and i just see a wall. no matter what i do, i'm just digging a deeper hole. it feels like some kind of sick joke, like i'm just supposed to keep working and dying just to pay off interest on things i'll never even enjoy. i feel like i'm already dead, just walking around.",
